<title>USA: Kirkwood CC, Iowa, $5.140 mln won by Fidelity Cap.</title>
<headline>Kirkwood CC, Iowa, $5.140 mln won by Fidelity Cap.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Capital Markets said it won $5.140 million of Kirkwood Community College, Iowa, Taxable industrial new jobs training certificates, Series 1996-1A, with a true interest cost of 6.53 percent.</p>
</text>
